<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 500 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills on</p>
<p>Friday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - October 21, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - July 21, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
